{{Codex|Three kills in rapid succession to summon a second ethereal Pyrana for twice the deadly punch.}}

'''Pyrana Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d variant of {{Weapon|Pyrana}}, sporting higher critical stats, longer range before damage falloff occurs, increased magazine size, and faster reload, at the expense of damage and slower fire rate. To compensate for these losses, when the weapon kills thrice in quick succession, a second ethereal Pyrana appears for a short time, transforming the weapon into an akimbo with doubled ammunition and firing speed. It was released alongside {{WF|Limbo Prime}} and {{Weapon|Destreza Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.
*'''3''' kills each within '''2''' seconds of the previous kill summons a second Pyrana Prime for '''6''' seconds, doubling its magazine size and increasing its [[fire rate]] by '''1.4x'''.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

{{Advantages|class=Shotgun Sidearm|
*Innate [[multishot]] of 10 pellets.
*Efficient ammo economy.
}}

{{Disadvantages|class=Shotgun Sidearm|
*Has linear damage falloff from 100% to 25% from 18m to 36m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
*Low overall [[status chance]].
*Low [[accuracy]].
*High recoil, especially on full auto and with the second Pyrana Prime.
*Shots go to the right and up. Horizontally it hits the rightmost side of the reticle at 3m, worsening at longer distances.
}}

